          "id": "fork",
          "title": "The fork",
          "text": [
            "Two lanterns hang at the fork below the Silver Citadel. The left one burns warm, the color of a kitchen window. The right one is cold and blue, and it hums.",
            "The milestone between them has lost its words. All that is left is a carved hand, pointing up the hill."
          ],
          "chose": "Follow the warm lantern"
        },
        {
          "id": "warm",
          "title": "The warm lantern",
          "text": [
            "The warm light walks a step ahead of you through the pines. When you stop, it stops. When you look back, the fork is gone and the road has closed behind you like a page."
          ],
          "chose": "Keep to the road"
        },
        {
          "id": "bridge",
          "title": "The miller's bridge",
          "text": [
            "The road runs out at a wooden bridge. Below it a mill wheel is turning, though the river is perfectly still.",
            "In the mill window a light moves from room to room. It is the same color as your lantern."
          ],
          "choices": ["Cross toward the citadel", "Climb down to the wheel"]
        }
      ]
